    "body": "This seems extremely related to https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1208 and similar things @MattiasBuelens was working on... but the fact that the reference implementation passes all WPTs implies the current spec should be good enough.\r\n\r\nDoes https://github.com/whatwg/streams/blob/e9355ce79925947e8eb496563d599c329769d315/reference-implementation/lib/abstract-ops/readable-streams.js#L150-L177 help? It doesn't really look like `Promise.all([dest.abort(), source.cancel()])` so I am not sure where you are getting that...",
